he definitive source for every version bump, bug fix, and new feature.\n    *   [MLX GitHub Releases](https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx/releases)\n2.  **MLX Documentation:** For high-level overviews of how to use new features.\n    *   [MLX Documentation Site](https://ml-explore.github.io/mlx/)\n\n**Tip:** If you are looking for specific model implementations (like how to run a specific new LLM), check the [MLX Examples repository](https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-examples) rather than the core framework repo, as model-specific code is often updated there first.", "tool_calls": [], "metrics": {"prompt_tokens": 261, "generation_tokens": 385, "prompt_tps": 1481.1045620683692, "generation_tps": 64.28508336858214, "peak_memory": 28.524214962, "reused_prefix": 116, "token_breakdown": {"thinking": 0, "visible": 383, "tool_json": 0, "marker_overhead": 2}}, "wall_s": 6.17}], "wall_s": 6.68, "aborted_reason": "", "score": {"parse_errors": 0, "hallucinated_tools": [], "final_ok": true, "turns_used": 2, "aborted": false, "first_shot_ok": true, "valid_call_ok": true, "corrected": false, "pass": true, "why": []}, "cot": {"turns": [{"ctrl_leaks": [], "think_chars": 0, "empty_think": true, "dup_rate": 0.0, "recite_rate": 0.0, "scripts": {"cjk": 0.0, "latin": 0.0, "other": 0.0}}, {"ctrl_leaks": [], "think_chars": 0, "empty_think": true, "dup_rate": 0.0, "recite_rate": 0.0, "scripts": {"cjk": 0.0, "latin": 0.0, "other": 0.0}}], "any_ctrl_leak": false, "max_dup_rate": 0.0, "max_recite_rate": 0.0, "max_other_script": 0.0, "empty_think_turns": 2, "think_chars_total": 0}}
